      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Go to the scene descriptor and set the dynamic material size to 0. Upload your world again. Let me know if that helps. Usually that is the problem because even when you remove something it will still be referenced by the scene descriptor, thus the build would contain those referenced files. Might also want to double check the dynamic prefabs list",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
